            "text": "Make.com Automation for Simple Business Tasks Hi! I’m learning and building practical automations with Make.com , and I’m available to help with small, clearly defined automation tasks. What I can help with: - Connecting Google Forms to Google Sheets - Sending automatic Gmail notifications - Organizing simple workflows using Make filters and routers - Setting up basic customer email workflows - Helping test and troubleshoot simple scenarios I have built a practice workflow using Google Forms, Google Sheets, Gmail, and Gemini for customer support and request classification. I’m interested in starting with small projects, with a clear scope and agreed requirements. If you need help with a simple Make automation, please describe your workflow and what you want to automate.",
